{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/f90353cfb26582d4e73ee385390b6c22.avif?t=1773173597\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep within the depths lies The Lab, a crumbling subterranean superstructure barely held together by the rusting metal and crumbling concrete.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Composed of many 2D hand crafted areas all with unique lore to discover...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your goal is to make it out of this place by whatever means necessary.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/3a49ea7a26c7307b69bbe4b3df72c2bc.avif?t=1773173597\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve a mix of puzzles in the world, make harrowing jumps, find hidden lore, nab important items, and escape monsters beyond your comprehension. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Navigating this world won't be easy, so keep your wits about, and stay alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Can you uncover the secrets of this strangely familiar world?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3897890/extras/8ee5379875724d8190abb5a597d154b5.avif?t=1773173597\" width=1226 height=138 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Within the dark depths you will encounter the long forgotten experiments that were created in The Lab, they'll hunt you, chase you, and make sure you never feel alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Its up to you whether you try to hide, try to run, or try to fight.</strong></p